  "title": "Shojo Null",
  "description": "In the 23rd century, humans use mindless organic robots called Gijin to do their every bidding. But when an escaped military Gijin named Marie frees herself from human control, it becomes clear that the Gijin aren’t so mindless after all. She vows to make a world where all Gijin are free, and there’s only one way to do that—to kill all humans!\n\n*Source: VIZ Media*\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Action, Androids, Cheerful Female Lead, Comedy, Conspiracy, Cyborg, Dead Parents, Drama, Eccentric Female Lead, Gore, Hunted Protagonist, Kind Male Lead, Male Protagonist, Mature, Orphan Male Lead, Personality Change, Protagonist Strong from the Start, Protective Male Lead, Revenge, School, Sci-Fi, Shounen, Split Personality, 23rd Century, Female Empowerment, Future, Futuristic Setting, Japan, Male Lead, Robots, Strong Female Lead, Tokyo",
